          "en": "besides manually typing this route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.52,
          "end": 38.91,
          "en": "this path here into our URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.91,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "So let's add a button to the server component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 45.27,
          "en": "I'll add some CSS classes to make this look nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.27,
          "end": 47.1,
          "en": "And of course I'll add a click listener where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.1,
          "end": 48.317,
          "en": "I say onEdit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 52.86,
          "en": "Now again, this is on a single server component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.86,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "So here I'll add the onEdit method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 59.64,
          "en": "And in here I now want to navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.64,
          "end": 62.25,
          "en": "to the edit server component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.25,
          "end": 63.45,
          "en": "We learned how to do this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.45,
          "end": 65.19,
          "en": "We need to get access to the router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.19,
          "end": 67.95,
          "en": "so that we are able to call the navigate method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "So let's inject it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 75.06,
          "en": "make sure to also add the import from @angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 77.88,
          "en": "And with that injected in onEdit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.88,
          "end": 80.31,
          "en": "we can navigate, you learned how to do this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.31,
          "end": 83.313,
          "en": "So maybe a time to pause the video and try it on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 86.82,
          "en": "This is how I would do it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.82,
          "end": 89.46000000000001,
          "en": "I would call my router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.46000000000001,
          "end": 91.41,
          "en": "Then of course we have the navigate method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.41,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "and here we need to pass an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 96.53999999999999,
          "en": "And we simply want to append edit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.53999999999999,
          "end": 99.06,
          "en": "to the end of the currently loaded route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.06,
          "end": 102.09,
          "en": "So you could of course also use /servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.09,
          "end": 103.56,
          "en": "the relative path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 106.05,
          "en": "Then use the ID of the currently routed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.05,
          "end": 110.07,
          "en": "loaded server again, server ID and then append edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.07,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "But since we already are on this path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "why not just use a relative route and just use edit?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 120.81,
          "en": "Now you learned if you want to use a relative route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.81,
          "end": 125.1,
          "en": "relative path here when using the navigate method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.1,
          "end": 128.85,
          "en": "you need to set up the relativeTo property here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.85,
          "end": 130.2,
          "en": "on the second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.2,
          "end": 132.99,
          "en": "on this object, you can pass to navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.99,
          "end": 135.06,
          "en": "and reference the currently loaded route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 138.69,
          "en": "so that the angler router knows to which route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.69,
          "end": 141.153,
          "en": "you want to navigate relatively.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 145.35,
          "en": "So with this, we should load the slash edit route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.35,
          "end": 146.46,
          "en": "We should append it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.46,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "to the end of our currently loaded route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 150.24,
          "en": "Let's see if this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.24,
          "end": 154.71,
          "en": "If we go to servers, click on a server and click on edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.71,
          "end": 157.62,
          "en": "We load the edit server page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.62,
          "end": 159.57,
          "en": "And now here we want to control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.57,
          "end": 162.54,
          "en": "on whether the user is allowed to update to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.54,
          "end": 164.76,
          "en": "edit the server or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.76,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "The issue is, you see, we theoretically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 172.5,
          "en": "have our query parems here allow edit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 174.75,
          "en": "always set to one in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.75,
          "end": 177.18,
          "en": "But we lose this information as soon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.18,
          "end": 179.31,
          "en": "as we click edit server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.31,
          "end": 181.71,
          "en": "So that is something we need to fix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.71,
          "end": 184.41,
          "en": "before we can use the information there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.41,
          "end": 187.14,
          "en": "We will fix it in the next lecture, before doing so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 187.14,
          "end": 189.72,
          "en": "let's implement the rest of the logic though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.72,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "Let's say here on the servers component where",
