          "end": 194.67,
          "en": "we set the allow edit query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 194.67,
          "end": 197.43,
          "en": "we don't always want to set this to one to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.43,
          "end": 199.56,
          "en": "therefore, we want to decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.56,
          "end": 201.9,
          "en": "on whether we want to allow the editing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 201.9,
          "end": 204.06,
          "en": "depending on the server ID let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.06,
          "end": 208.86,
          "en": "So only if the server ID equals three let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.86,
          "end": 211.35,
          "en": "only in this case, we want to allow edit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.35,
          "end": 212.88,
          "en": "so we want to set it to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.88,
          "end": 215.19,
          "en": "Otherwise we will set it to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.19,
          "end": 218.55,
          "en": "So that's just ternary expression, checking the server ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.55,
          "end": 221.46,
          "en": "And if it's not equal to three, we'll set it to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 221.46,
          "end": 224.43,
          "en": "So we will set the allow edit parameter to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.43,
          "end": 225.87,
          "en": "That's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 225.87,
          "end": 228.12,
          "en": "Now an edit server of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 228.12,
          "end": 231.27,
          "en": "we want to be able to retrieve our query params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.27,
          "end": 234.57,
          "en": "So here we already get the subscribe method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.57,
          "end": 236.61,
          "en": "on the query params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 236.61,
          "end": 237.87,
          "en": "Now here I want to determine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 237.87,
          "end": 240.57,
          "en": "on whether we are allowed to edit or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 240.57,
          "end": 244.23,
          "en": "So I will add a new allow edit property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 244.23,
          "end": 246.99,
          "en": "and set it to false initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 246.99,
          "end": 250.54,
          "en": "But whenever this changes here in the query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.4,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "I want to get my query params, which are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 259.353,
          "en": "alls of type params to be imported from @angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.28,
          "end": 262.51,
          "en": "And then here in the method body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 263.4,
          "end": 266.91,
          "en": "I will set this allow edit equal to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 266.91,
          "end": 269.28,
          "en": "my query params here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.28,
          "end": 274.28,
