          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 274.71,
          "end": 279.03,
          "en": "And now this ever is one string of one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 279.03,
          "end": 281.85,
          "en": "Of course, you could also pass true as a string here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.85,
          "end": 284.7,
          "en": "In which case I want to set allow edit to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.7,
          "end": 288.57,
          "en": "If it is not one, I will set it to false though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 288.57,
          "end": 291.69,
          "en": "And in the template of this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 291.69,
          "end": 293.85,
          "en": "we could simply add a heading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.85,
