          "en": "you're not allowed to edit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 300.6,
          "end": 304.71,
          "en": "if, and we can use ngIF for this, if allow edit is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.71,
          "end": 306.893,
          "en": "So if not allow edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
